==Battleground==
*1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns as the boss after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4.67~11.33 seconds<sup>140f~340f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage will be slightly more difficult due to Moe Uzumasa & Doge being at 100% magnification, but it is still easy to beat.

